### ==========================================
### 统计 Statistics
### ==========================================

### 获取夜班次数统计 (所有用户)
GET http://localhost:3205/api/Statistics

### 获取单个用户执勤时间统计
GET http://localhost:3205/api/users/1/dutyStatistics?startDate=2025-01-01&startTime=00:00:00&endDate=2025-12-31&endTime=23:59:59

### 获取单个用户夜班次数统计
GET http://localhost:3205/api/users/1/nightCount?startDate=2025-01-01&startTime=00:00:00&endDate=2025-12-31&endTime=23:59:59
